 60 meters (6.79 sec), 100 meters (10.59 sec), long jump (6.92 m) and triple jump (14.57 m). O'Hara Head football coach, George Stratts reluctantly started Jones as a freshman. Jones had immediate success on the field and was a four-year starter, breaking many school records. As a senior, he led his team to a Philadelphia Catholic League Championship and became the Catholic League's all-time leading rusher. Jones is the inaugural winner\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0428-5a4ca9e01a2b:d01\", \"text\": \"Kevin Jones (basketball) Kevin Andrew Jones (born August 25, 1989) is an American professional basketball player who plays for Nanterre 92. He played college basketball for West Virginia University. Jones attended Mount Vernon High School in Mount Vernon, New York. As a junior, he averaged 21 points, 12 rebounds, two blocks per game. As a senior, he averaged 23 points, 14 rebounds, and two blocks per game. In 2006 and 2007, he led Mount Vernon to the New York State PHSAA championships. In his freshman season at West Virginia, Jones posted eight games in double figures, including a stretch of\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0428-5a4ca9e01a2b:d02\", \"text\": \"to measure up to what he assumed to be the \\\"norm\\\", and continued to practice hard for their next competition in Austin, TX. In Austin, Texas, 1987, Jones entered his 3rd AFA Masters contest, debuting four of his own tricks, the \\\"Locomotive\\\", the \\\"Trolley\\\", the \\\"Standup Infinity Roll\\\", and the \\\"Elephant Glide\\\". Months later at the velodrome in Carson, California, Jones had an amazing, flawless run, debuting another new trick called the \\\"Dump Truck\\\" where he turned the bike upside down while riding a wheelie from the rear pegs. Around this time, fellow Plywood Hood member & film maker Mark\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0428-5a4ca9e01a2b:d03\", \"text\": \": Inside your Ozone hole ! Signed up : 2011-10-25 Posts : 4405 For Sale : 65 Offline Re : Day 6 ) Kevin Jones Last edited by flatland1974 ( 2020-03-30 9:46am ) Taking NOS to POS since 1984 ! ! ! Offline # 18 2020-03-31 3:59am pwh4130 Pro Member From : The 1980 's Signed up : 2008-11-05 Posts : 2653 Bikes : 10 Website Offline Re : Day 6 ) Kevin Jones Let 's not forget Kevin could do it all . He quit racing because he won and it was n't fun . In the pre Hoods\"}], \"fallible_prior\": [\"Football\"], \"prior_explanation\": \"Kevin Jones is primarily known for playing American football as a running back in the NFL.\", \"fallible_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0428-5a4ca9e01a2b:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0428-5a4ca9e01a2b:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Kevin Jones\", \"scope\": \"sport\", \"claim\": \"Kevin Jones is associated with football.\", \"answer\": \"football\", \"quote\": \"O'Hara Head football coach, George Stratts reluctantly started Jones as a freshman. Jones had immediate success on the field and was a four-year starter, breaking many school records. As a senior, he led his team to a Philadelphia Catholic League Championship and became the Catholic League's all-time leading rusher.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0428-5a4ca9e01a2b:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0428-5a4ca9e01a2b:d00:c1\", \"entity\": \"Kevin Jones\", \"scope\": \"sport\", \"claim\": \"Kevin Jones is associated with track and field.\", \"answer\": \"track and field\", \"quote\": \"Jones was a star track and field athlete, excelling in the 60 meters (6.79 sec), 100 meters (10.59 sec), long jump (6.92 m) and triple jump (14.57 m).\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0428-5a4ca9e01a2b:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0428-5a4ca9e01a2b:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Kevin Jones\", \"scope\": \"sport\", \"claim\": \"Kevin Jones is associated with basketball.\", \"answer\": \"basketball\", \"quote\": \"Kevin Jones (basketball) Kevin Andrew Jones (born August 25, 1989) is an American professional basketball player who plays for Nanterre 92.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ram